lines:
That Rusturf Tunnel there...{be01}
At first, we had a huge work crew boring
through rock with the latest machinery.{be00}
But, we had to stop.{be01}
It turns out that we would have had
a negative effect on wild Pokémon in{be00}
the area.{be01}
So, we’ve got nothing to do but loll
around here doing nothing.

有个男人正独自向绿
茵镇方向挖掘。{be00}
他急着想打通隧道。{be01}
说是只要不用机械慢
慢挖就不会惊扰宝可
梦{be00}
也能保护自然环境。{be01}
不知道他现在挖通了
没有？

要绕开隧道去绿茵镇
的话，得先渡海到武
斗镇，{be00}
再坐船到凯那市，{be00}
最后穿过紫堇市才行
。
